{
    "title": "Magic Piano Music game",
    "description": "\ud83d\udcd0 Game rules:\r\n1.Click/long press the black piano block\r\n2.Avoid missing any black piano pieces you see\r\n3.The rhythm of the music and the falling speed of the piano pieces gradually accelerate\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb9 Game features:\r\n1.A variety of music genres meet your various musical tastes, and we have thousands of songs waiting for you to conquer!\r\n2.Carefully crafted online PK, you can compete with countless players from all over the world!\r\n3.Unique ranking, improving your ranking can help you stand out among all players and become number one!\r\n\r\n\u270c\ufe0f Scoring and combo:\r\nEvery time you correctly click on the piano piece, you can get a score. Continuous and accurate clicks can earn rewards and accumulate higher scores!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfb6 Complete track:\r\nIn some modes, you need to play the entire track as fully as possible in order to successfully pass the level or refresh the record.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcca Ranking competition:\r\nThe game includes a global ranking function, where you can view your current music score ranking.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcdc Request permission:\r\nTo provide the best gaming experience, we need you to provide permissions such as \"storage\" and \"WiFi\" when downloading games.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Built in VIP subscription in the game: By activating the subscription function, you can receive a large number of exclusive benefits.\r\n\r\nGet ready to try the most challenging piano music game for free!\r\nBecome a true master of piano pieces.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udcd0 Game rules:<br>1.Click/long press the black piano block<br>2.Avoid missing any black piano pieces you see<br>3.The rhythm of the music and the falling speed of the piano pieces gradually accelerate<br><br>\ud83c\udfb9 Game features:<br>1.A variety of music genres meet your various musical tastes, and we have thousands of songs waiting for you to conquer!<br>2.Carefully crafted online PK, you can compete with countless players from all over the world!<br>3.Unique ranking, improving your ranking can help you stand out among all players and become number one!<br><br>\u270c\ufe0f Scoring and combo:<br>Every time you correctly click on the piano piece, you can get a score. Continuous and accurate clicks can earn rewards and accumulate higher scores!<br><br>\ud83c\udfb6 Complete track:<br>In some modes, you need to play the entire track as fully as possible in order to successfully pass the level or refresh the record.<br><br>\ud83d\udcca Ranking competition:<br>The game includes a global ranking function, where you can view your current music score ranking.<br><br>\ud83d\udcdc Request permission:<br>To provide the best gaming experience, we need you to provide permissions such as &quot;storage&quot; and &quot;WiFi&quot; when downloading games.<br><br>\ud83d\ude80 Built in VIP subscription in the game: By activating the subscription function, you can receive a large number of exclusive benefits.<br><br>Get ready to try the most challenging piano music game for free!<br>Become a true master of piano pieces.",
